; Ripple field - concentric waves through a serpentine scan.
; ONE continuous stroke: the line snakes left-right across the square and
; every row is displaced by a circular ripple decaying from the centre.
; 150 mm square, 38 rows 4 mm apart, 15 mm ripple wavelength.
;
;   >>> PLACE THE PEN AT THE BOTTOM-LEFT of the Hilbert square. <<<
;   Same corner you started the Hilbert from. Different coloured pen.
;
; No pen lifts anywhere - the turns at each end are part of the drawing.
